 Staff Nurse is best positioned as a clinical nursing pathway for qualified nursing professionals seeking stronger academic preparation and broader opportunities in hospital and community healthcare."},{"type":"p","text":"The core employability combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Medical-Surgical Nursing","Patient Assessment","Pharmacology","Medication Safety","Emergency Care","Infection Control","Clinical Documentation"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"For long-term growth, add:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Critical Care/Emergency Specialization","BLS","Digital Health","Healthcare Quality","Leadership","Nursing Administration"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This creates a progression from Staff Nurse toward Senior Staff Nurse, specialized clinical nursing, Ward In-Charge, Nursing Supervisor, Nursing Superintendent, Nursing Education, and healthcare administration."}]}]}